#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:1 80fcf6693b554f17aaecafbe354f7405
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:3 8b049716b36c40a1a7fac81f831e1331
msgid "Frequently asked questions and common troubleshooting solutions."
msgstr "常见问题与故障排除方案。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:5 a365ffe404834562911dcf192b5f9e28
msgid "Installation Issues"
msgstr "安装问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:7 34af03c5aaea4c1694e4c1274d3a6337
msgid "Q: rosdep init fails with \"already initialized\""
msgstr "问： rosdep init fails with \\\"already initialized\\\""

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:9 cb03751a8ef146bfac68fcdc9bbcff4b
msgid "This is normal if you've used ROS 2 before. Just run update:"
msgstr "如果以前使用过 ROS 2，这是正常现象。直接执行更新即可："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:11 e4f73634c252497da051d5f971bfb9b5
msgid "rosdep update\n"
msgstr "rosdep update\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:15 193b8a6f1b964713b6a2ec9839d55dc4
msgid "Q: Package not found after apt install"
msgstr "问：apt install 后找不到软件包"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:17 a3a6c752599d4169a17a62da37b512d0
msgid "Source the ROS 2 setup and update:"
msgstr "加载 ROS 2 环境并更新："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:19 6606608a981443e291e47435f69a4b99
msgid ""
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
msgstr ""
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"sudo apt update\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:24 5fe148758e1342beb8371bb437640ad3
msgid "Q: OCS2 `.deb` not found via apt"
msgstr "问：用 apt 找不到 OCS2 `.deb`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:26 3abf401b2bca4a28919ab442bfc091f2
msgid ""
"OCS2 is **not** published to ROS 2 / Ubuntu apt software sources. `sudo apt "
"install ros-jazzy-ocs2` will not find it."
msgstr ""
"OCS2 **没有**发布到 ROS 2 / Ubuntu apt 软件源。`sudo apt install ros-jazzy-ocs2` "
"找不到该包。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:28 8bd468bc106d4da88d009d6e46e3f981
msgid ""
"**Primary path:** in `open-deploy-ws` / `fa-deploy-ws`, run "
"`./init_repo.sh`. Choose `d` for OCS2 (menu 1), switch source ↔ deb with "
"menu **2**, or install/update with menu **3** "
"(`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`)."
msgstr ""
"**主路径：** 在 `open-deploy-ws` / `fa-deploy-ws` 中运行 `./init_repo.sh`。给 OCS2 选 "
"`d`（菜单 1），用菜单 **2** 在源码 ↔ deb 之间切换，或用菜单 **3** "
"安装/更新（`./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`）。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:30 9350a4c6dd424df8960f7c5add7c0c6e
msgid "To build from source, choose `s` during init (or menu 2)."
msgstr "要从源码构建，在 init（或菜单 2）时选 `s`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:32 1213dbd432904529a038089593ba3228
msgid "Manual fallback"
msgstr "手动回退"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:35 32bddf16a39e4ca697e4662073a52f6e
msgid ""
"Download the matching asset from [ocs2_ros2 "
"Releases](https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2/releases) and `sudo dpkg -i "
"ros-jazzy-ocs2_*.deb` only if you are not using a deploy workspace."
msgstr ""
"仅当你没有使用部署工作空间时，才从 [ocs2_ros2 "
"Releases](https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2/releases) 下载匹配资源并执行 `sudo "
"dpkg -i ros-jazzy-ocs2_*.deb`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:38 272ac6959b03400bb9343051edc6bf5a
msgid "Submodule Issues"
msgstr "子模块问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:40 9704af19c3cb4d5ebd96667c47aae4d0
msgid "Q: Submodules are empty after clone"
msgstr "问：克隆后子模块为空"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:42 070ff40809a94d5c947741e807b3fa1e
msgid ""
"In `open-deploy-ws` / `fa-deploy-ws`, re-run `./init_repo.sh` (menu 1). In "
"FaSim-Isaac / fa-py-libraries / lerobot_ros2, re-run that repo’s `./init.sh`"
" (or `./init.sh all`). Do not start with a recursive `git submodule update "
"--init --recursive`."
msgstr ""
"在 `open-deploy-ws` / `fa-deploy-ws` 中再跑 `./init_repo.sh`（菜单 1）。在 FaSim-Isaac"
" / fa-py-libraries / lerobot_ros2 中再跑该仓库的 `./init.sh`（或 `./init.sh "
"all`）。不要从递归的 `git submodule update --init --recursive` 开始。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:44 2b67edd1de4d4027abd36e6c3e92dae2
msgid "Q: Access denied to submodule"
msgstr "问：子模块访问被拒绝"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:46 aeb98a777e314583bc679193700e3cb3
msgid ""
"This usually means you're trying to access a private submodule without "
"proper access."
msgstr "这通常表示你正在访问私有子模块，但没有相应权限。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:48 789e9ead705347248cc66fe6c01752a2
msgid ""
"**For open-deploy-ws:** Only public submodules should be needed. Check that:"
msgstr "**对于 open-deploy-ws：** 只需公开子模块。请确认："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:49 7f46e366b7fc4c6ba4fbaf404aea3746
msgid "You're on the correct branch"
msgstr "当前位于正确的分支"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:50 f9367459be974fd2bad3aa8dc8dda9f6
msgid "The submodule is listed as public in `submodules_visibility.conf`"
msgstr "该子模块在 `submodules_visibility.conf` 中列为公开"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:52 6dc77d5234214a5dbd99b3b7822619eb
msgid ""
"**For fa-deploy-ws:** Verify your GitHub SSH key has access to private "
"repos:"
msgstr "**对于 fa-deploy-ws：** 确认你的 GitHub SSH 密钥有权访问私有仓库："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:54 8e1bfa1ecb0541dbade2aadc52ddb950
msgid "ssh -T git@github.com\n"
msgstr "ssh -T git@github.com\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:58 4b19144c50a84fffb51a36477d433481
msgid "Q: Submodule conflicts during update"
msgstr "问：更新时出现子模块冲突"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:60 9bc7745d8e5844f89dbc9116600bed1d
msgid ""
"git submodule foreach git checkout .\n"
"git submodule update --init\n"
msgstr ""
"git submodule foreach git checkout .\n"
"git submodule update --init\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:65 94cebb08483040ca88fcdf4e110dd128
msgid "Build Issues"
msgstr "编译问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:67 564ea361162b4236b4dc84c21e7763cd
msgid "Q: colcon build fails with missing dependency"
msgstr "问：colcon build 因缺少依赖而失败"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:69 dfb30f05b42443baa0faab765d4be109
msgid "Install dependencies via rosdep:"
msgstr "通过 rosdep 安装依赖："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:71 022ed1c7af0a4e049e1f6efa8c5c6642
msgid "rosdep install --from-paths src --ignore-src -r -y\n"
msgstr "rosdep install --from-paths src --ignore-src -r -y\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:75 42906c91be2040a1b04c5b6e5897cec5
msgid "Q: numpy version conflict"
msgstr "问：numpy 版本冲突"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:77 d2381ee120a7425b965c12411bbdc91e
msgid "Some packages require numpy < 2:"
msgstr "部分软件包要求 numpy < 2："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:79 15da6496660a44669d379a7cf2f96419
msgid "pip install 'numpy<2'\n"
msgstr "pip install 'numpy<2'\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:83 2442b11cc45a4a6a98a8110d9ac8d89c
msgid "Q: CMake cannot find package"
msgstr "问：CMake 找不到软件包"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:85 ff17c45fba974f31ac0f98cead661e8b
msgid "Ensure ROS 2 is sourced before building:"
msgstr "编译前请先加载 ROS 2 环境："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:87 4bf6199c99f64d839f67b371dded73a8
msgid ""
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"colcon build\n"
msgstr ""
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"colcon build\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:92 5d5d9ca6575743d48cbc64cb8bcd7ca9
msgid "Q: Build runs out of memory"
msgstr "问：编译时内存不足"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:94 4f4da7cdb58d45bfb7cac02971cffd7b
msgid "Limit parallel jobs:"
msgstr "限制并行任务数："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:96 5ce478871c8e41ed8250c04b8fde26bf
msgid "colcon build --parallel-workers 2\n"
msgstr "colcon build --parallel-workers 2\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:100
#: f618f858b2094fc589f46fefcb2ec220
msgid "Or build specific packages:"
msgstr "或者只编译指定软件包："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:102
#: 218e47c40b3a47d8bbc3ab47cf32f45f
msgid "colcon build --packages-up-to <package-name>\n"
msgstr "colcon build --packages-up-to <package-name>\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:106
#: 2dc8b0fa0a304cd795a1844d93c264c1
msgid "Runtime Issues"
msgstr "运行时问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:108
#: f4c6aae6ea8a45c7876ef17bacd82841
msgid "Q: Node/topic not found"
msgstr "问：找不到节点/话题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:110
#: 8252fecf7aa44d56a34f86885d1ea791
msgid "Ensure workspace is sourced:"
msgstr "确认已加载工作空间环境："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:112
#: 2f29b6a35aab4c1e8dd25cc97676e3b4
msgid "source install/setup.bash\n"
msgstr "source install/setup.bash\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:116
#: 702571fd57f14655bab3429002cacb23
msgid "Check if the node is running:"
msgstr "检查节点是否在运行："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:118
#: eb1e5bd7818e42239bed0d3ac1449ee6
msgid ""
"ros2 node list\n"
"ros2 topic list\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 node list\n"
"ros2 topic list\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:123
#: da55552d55b44a70b217a160952dffea
msgid "Q: Controller fails to start"
msgstr "问：控制器无法启动"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:125
#: 3633f3f6dcd444f6bfa55ac3cf4578ee
msgid "Check that:"
msgstr "请检查："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:126
#: aaacc8ad32a04be5aed6658d1ce1e785
msgid "Hardware parameter matches your setup (`mock`, `gz`, `isaac`, or real)"
msgstr "硬件参数与当前环境匹配（`mock`、`gz`、`isaac` 或真实硬件）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:127
#: c724193893b541818179a15746c8a5ec
msgid "Robot parameter matches available descriptions"
msgstr "机器人参数与可用描述包匹配"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:128
#: c94fba4d457a41e7a172e96f51e2b562
msgid "Required hardware interfaces are initialized"
msgstr "所需硬件接口已初始化"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:130
#: a4c5fccd8b0141979d174ce2d7b698ce
msgid ""
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=mock "
"robot:=dobot_cr5\n"
msgstr ""
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=mock "
"robot:=dobot_cr5\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:134
#: 3b8d225789e24af1918e9a2c82ccd1a1
msgid "Q: No communication between machines"
msgstr "问：机器之间无法通信"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:136
#: eccbc0c693494ac1aedc96ee7c22ea60
msgid "Verify:"
msgstr "请确认："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:137
#: 78662425000f41a7976c6317a2a8d51c
msgid "ROS Domain ID matches on both machines"
msgstr "两台机器上的 ROS Domain ID 一致"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:138
#: 41db5b4fdd7e47f582a305ddb7fb023c
msgid "Network connectivity exists"
msgstr "网络连通正常"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:139
#: 26872353bc764102ba4a2c117237fe08
msgid "Firewall allows ROS 2 traffic"
msgstr "防火墙允许 ROS 2 通信"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:141
#: e4ca7b762e954a71bdb7a301788874eb
msgid ""
"# Check domain ID\n"
"echo $ROS_DOMAIN_ID\n"
"\n"
"# Test connectivity\n"
"ros2 topic list  # Should show topics from both machines\n"
msgstr ""
"# Check domain ID\n"
"echo $ROS_DOMAIN_ID\n"
"\n"
"# Test connectivity\n"
"ros2 topic list  # Should show topics from both machines\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:149
#: 20fb62d1c9e44ac4b8085a5820b7e3a8
msgid "CAN Interface Issues"
msgstr "CAN 接口问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:151
#: 060335b924184041a789bf3dacd9c97f
msgid "Q: CAN interface not found"
msgstr "问：找不到 CAN 接口"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:153
#: 8bb0aa0e202541069b986ecc6f677344
msgid "Check if the interface exists:"
msgstr "检查接口是否存在："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:155
#: 323e1830b1d04475a60b2f0b4660f0a0
msgid "ip link show\n"
msgstr "ip link show\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:159
#: d83b2a00726241bbabb787cb0d659a61
msgid "If the interface has a different name, rename it:"
msgstr "若接口名称不同，请将其重命名："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:161
#: 8466f66ec9ae4341a26d3cfc356cd0bd
msgid ""
"sudo ip link set can0 down\n"
"sudo ip link set can0 name <expected_name>\n"
"sudo ip link set <expected_name> up\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo ip link set can0 down\n"
"sudo ip link set can0 name <expected_name>\n"
"sudo ip link set <expected_name> up\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:167
#: b4e6cfdd81234bbb9418fdc7957fc59c
msgid "Q: CAN communication timeout"
msgstr "问：CAN 通信超时"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:169
#: fddef0246a4348a9b3cc97ed21d4c3ba
msgid "Verify CAN bus is properly terminated"
msgstr "确认 CAN 总线已正确端接"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:170
#: a6b78c5942934d54b004df2965fb9463
msgid "Check baud rate matches robot configuration"
msgstr "确认波特率与机器人配置一致"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:171
#: 058c00fb09d34dee99f6c5c6e1a9eead
msgid "Ensure no conflicting CAN traffic"
msgstr "确保没有冲突的 CAN 通信"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:173
#: 76cbc40f61e245dbbd19c9cd974c23a0
msgid "Simulation Issues"
msgstr "仿真问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:175
#: ac1f7a169977410c81e788c96f753852
msgid "Q: Gazebo crashes on launch"
msgstr "问：Gazebo 启动时崩溃"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:177
#: 8e1489cb475740679193ad98531f10fa
msgid "Install all Gazebo packages:"
msgstr "安装全部 Gazebo 软件包："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:179
#: 130d3ed5e0474a489e4cc49fb6737c2d
msgid "sudo apt install ros-jazzy-gz-*\n"
msgstr "sudo apt install ros-jazzy-gz-*\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:183
#: 2a3fb8993ccd4682a79a1fc630526501
msgid "Check GPU drivers if using hardware rendering."
msgstr "若使用硬件渲染，请检查 GPU 驱动。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:185
#: e8013ed2cf7442c29bbf6cd20e3af6df
msgid "Q: Isaac Sim won't start or scripts fail"
msgstr "问：Isaac Sim 无法启动或脚本失败"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:187
#: 121e0ba5679445bf8b052ebb57d9a046
msgid ""
"Use **FaSim-Isaac** `./init.sh` / `./run.sh`. Default Isaac path is "
"`ISAACSIM_DIR` (`~/isaacsim` unless overridden in "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf`). Version for the optional Isaac ROS 2 workspace "
"comes from the `./init.sh` operation 2 menu (GitHub tags; fallback in "
"`config/fa_sim.conf`: `6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`) — do not assume a single "
"hardcoded minor version."
msgstr ""
"使用 **FaSim-Isaac** 的 `./init.sh` / `./run.sh`。默认 Isaac 路径是 "
"`ISAACSIM_DIR`（除非在 `config/fa_sim.local.conf` 覆盖，否则为 `~/isaacsim`）。可选 Isaac "
"ROS 2 工作空间版本来自 `./init.sh` 操作 2 菜单（GitHub tag；回退见 "
"`config/fa_sim.conf`：`6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`）— 不要假定某一个写死的次版本号。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:189
#: 0dc6cdc7a23348d1ad4485e6234b8056
msgid ""
"Confirm the directory in `ISAACSIM_DIR` exists and contains the launch "
"scripts named in `config/fa_sim.conf` (`isaac-sim.sh`, …)"
msgstr ""
"确认 `ISAACSIM_DIR` 目录存在，且包含 `config/fa_sim.conf` 中的启动脚本（`isaac-sim.sh` 等）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:190
#: 2a26ab57a386468a9ff3575fd45f2195
msgid ""
"Copy `config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` → `config/fa_sim.local.conf` if "
"Isaac is not at `~/isaacsim`"
msgstr ""
"若 Isaac 不在 `~/isaacsim`，复制 `config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` → "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:191
#: 9c98b39dd05042f0ada5ced2dc20bbad
msgid ""
"Re-run `./run.sh` and pick PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming from the menu"
" (`./run.sh` has no `--headless` / `--robot` flags)"
msgstr ""
"再跑 `./run.sh`，从菜单选 PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming（`./run.sh` 没有 "
"`--headless` / `--robot` 参数）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:193
#: a423f533c9104b29905293feb3310880
msgid "Q: Isaac Sim connection fails"
msgstr "问：Isaac Sim 连接失败"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:195
#: ed54fcc0ef414f80998374f593186153
msgid "Verify Isaac Sim is running (`./run.sh` from FaSim-Isaac)"
msgstr "确认 Isaac Sim 正在运行（从 FaSim-Isaac 执行 `./run.sh`）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:196
#: 4aa2d8e3b9844affa5a398da8a5b2a57
msgid "Check that the topic bridge is active"
msgstr "确认话题桥接已激活"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:197
#: 940e7f0a4e1a4233a444304354c31995
msgid "Ensure `hardware:=isaac` is set in launch"
msgstr "确认 launch 中已设置 `hardware:=isaac`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:198
#: deeffca2d4d54f4289835cd4a18fda94
msgid "Check Domain ID matches between Isaac and ROS 2"
msgstr "确认 Isaac 与 ROS 2 的 Domain ID 一致"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:200
#: db7da87acf9d4411aaa3ecedbc253b66
msgid "Network Configuration"
msgstr "网络配置"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:202
#: f69e0f7a458044daa3a3afe6241ef35b
msgid "Q: How do I find the correct Domain ID?"
msgstr "问：如何查找正确的 Domain ID？"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:204
#: f13cc323c6934458a0ed86c91c85e642
msgid ""
"The Domain ID is robot-specific. For internal deployments, consult your "
"robot's documentation or team lead. For development with mock hardware, any "
"ID works (default is 0)."
msgstr "Domain ID 因机器人而异。内部部署请查阅机器人文档或向团队负责人确认。使用模拟硬件开发时，任意 ID 均可（默认为 0）。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:206
#: fa17bf88249b4c3fb879a965a0f1fa3f
msgid "Q: Zenoh vs DDS?"
msgstr "问：Zenoh 与 DDS 如何选择？"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:208
#: e8b037794f21483abe0d396accd0c441
msgid "**DDS (default):** Works out of the box for same-network communication"
msgstr "**DDS（默认）：** 同网通信即开即用"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:209
#: 28ec5fb5917f4edcac4fb61447f567fb
msgid ""
"**Zenoh:** Better for cross-network, NAT traversal, or high-latency links"
msgstr "**Zenoh：** 更适合跨网络、NAT 穿透或高延迟链路"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:211
#: 09263d85a4604ce8826edb21e3ece149
msgid "To use Zenoh:"
msgstr "使用 Zenoh："

